// The settlement and mutual release between Elena Voss and Northgate Parking (settlement.md).
Document "settlement.md"

Fact party Identified by Elena, Northgate
Fact claimant Identified by Elena
Fact defendant Identified by Northgate
Fact matter Identified by Incident, AnotherMatter
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Param settlement-sum : Money(USD, 2) = 1800000
Param payment-window : Duration = 14

// 1. The lawsuit, and effect on both signatures
Fact pending Identified by party * party' * matter
Fact signed Identified by party
Bool rescinded
Bool in-effect
  Holds when (Forall party: signed()) && Not(rescinded())
Act sign Actor party
  Holds when True
  Creates signed()

// 2. Payment: the whole sum within fourteen days of taking effect
Var paid Identified by usd
Bool paid-in-full
  Holds when paid.usd >= settlement-sum
Bool paid-late
Act pay Actor defendant Recipient claimant Related to usd
  Holds when in-effect()
  Creates paid(paid.usd + usd), paid-late() When Held(in-effect()) For payment-window
Duty payment-due Holder defendant Claimant claimant
  Holds when in-effect() && Not(paid-in-full())
  Due within payment-window

// 3. Release: only on full payment; then no released claim is brought, and the lawsuit is dismissed
Bool released
  Holds when in-effect() && paid-in-full()
Power sue Actor party Recipient party' Related to matter
  Holds when Not(released() && matter == Incident)
  Valid when Not(released() && matter == Incident)
  Creates pending()
Duty dismissal-due Holder claimant Claimant defendant
  Holds when released() && pending(claimant, defendant, Incident)
  Due within 7
Act dismiss-lawsuit Actor claimant Recipient defendant
  Holds when pending(claimant, defendant, Incident)
  Terminates pending(claimant, defendant, Incident)

// 4. Late payment: the claimant may rescind, and then returns what was paid
Bool payment-late
  Holds when Violated(payment-due()) || paid-late()
Power rescind Actor claimant Recipient defendant
  Holds when payment-late()
  Valid when payment-late()
  Creates rescinded()
Duty return-due Holder claimant Claimant defendant
  Holds when rescinded() && paid.usd > 0
Act return-payment Actor claimant Recipient defendant Related to usd
  Holds when rescinded()
  Valid when usd == paid.usd
  Creates paid(0)

// 5. Confidentiality
Fact compelled Identified by party
Event legal-demand Related to party Creates compelled()
Act disclose-terms Actor party
  Holds when compelled()

// 6. No admission
Fact admission Identified by party
Invariant no-admission When Not(Exists party: admission())

Clause 1.1 Approved "d3e62c809f6964e117d22b3590e038e7b0274a6b31db981244fb0738b672c102"
  Definition "Elena Voss, the claimant, has sued Northgate Parking, the defendant, over the collapse of a garage gate onto her car, which this agreement calls the incident."
Clause 1.2 Approved "c8eab7b3047e92f5ebdca073cb6592e19cb6d79726ed8b43bf01e0c0d73dd0b1"
  Norm "This agreement takes effect when both parties have signed it." => sign
Clause 2.1 Approved "fce093f4fdd9a5c434db71992ff5a31fa612230acca1518e20cd368170653707"
  Norm "The defendant pays the claimant eighteen thousand dollars within fourteen days after this agreement takes effect." => payment-due, pay
Clause 3.1 Approved "3d7331c32d07aa7732ec881bef596f67d10110b2bb786e507a72a436365e5dcd"
  Norm "When the defendant has paid in full, each party releases the other from every claim arising from the incident." => pay, sue
  Norm " Until then no claim is released." => sue
Clause 3.2 Approved "1932bed618aa94b8995e6e2f7805507060ef1913ac25a4dfb17759694577c5fa"
  Norm "Neither party brings a claim that it has released." => sue
Clause 3.3 Approved "d8e5d60224ccc9f6bc6ea43168d890208c3ba28d8fed712c0ea3d550343f7351"
  Norm "The claimant dismisses the lawsuit within seven days after the defendant has paid in full." => dismissal-due, dismiss-lawsuit
Clause 4.1 Approved "ef794762439ec36f5dfb212e4ba35b8c95277443e67174d1efce6393abe4152b"
  Norm "If the defendant has not paid in full within the fourteen days, the claimant may rescind this agreement." => rescind
  Norm " After rescission the release is treated as never having taken effect, and the claimant returns whatever the defendant has paid." => rescind, sue, return-due, return-payment
Clause 5.1 Approved "a3170acebefee30b65e783b5efae09b13da6dae4f23b7c428ee7f74a506012db"
  Norm "Neither party discloses the terms of this agreement." => disclose-terms
  Norm " A party may disclose them where the law requires it." => disclose-terms
Clause 6.1 Approved "8ab0342dab328ead00739c6aaf804a753a1ea56c8bddaccce3ce77c70ebd0e3a"
  Invariant "Nothing in this agreement is an admission of fault by either party." => no-admission
.
+paid(0). +pending(Elena, Northgate, Incident).
